{"id":"97a6f341b7a6e48c","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism.md","title":"Canonical Monoidal Morphism","display":"df-canonical-monoidal-morphism — Canonical Monoidal Morphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism","aliases":["93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism"],"display":"df-canonical-monoidal-morphism — Canonical Monoidal Morphism","depends_on":["[[93-df-category]]","[[93-df-monoidal-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-canonical-monoidal-morphism — Canonical Monoidal Morphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0f2bb87045d6238a\" href=\"?note=0f2bb87045d6238a\" title=\"93-df-monoidal-category\">93-df-monoidal-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> is a six-component monoidal-category candidate; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}\">\\(\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}\\)</span> are the sourced monoidal-category predicate, object projection, and hom-family notation of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0f2bb87045d6238a\" href=\"?note=0f2bb87045d6238a\" title=\"93-df-monoidal-category\">93-df-monoidal-category</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\">\\(\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\">\\(\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Can}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Can}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G_{93}\">\\(\\mathcal G_{93}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\">\\(\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FObj}^{n}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FObj}^{n}_{93}\\)</span> 的下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SFAr}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{SFAr}_{93}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SFGen}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{SFGen}_{93}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SFCanMor}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{SFCanMor}_{93}\\)</span> 在满足上述六元幺半范畴谓词的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> 上定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}\\)</span> 及约束逆来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0f2bb87045d6238a\" href=\"?note=0f2bb87045d6238a\" title=\"93-df-monoidal-category\">93-df-monoidal-category</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}\\)</span> 显式记录形式源和形式靶，原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Can}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Can}_{93}\\)</span> 不作重定义为该新关系。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle:X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle:X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\langle\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_X,X,X\\rangle:X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\Bigl\\{\\left\\langle\\alpha_{A,B,C},\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\otimes),C;\\otimes),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(B,C;\\otimes);\\otimes)\\right\\rangle:\nA,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\Bigl\\{\\left\\langle\\alpha^{-1}_{A,B,C},\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(B,C;\\otimes);\\otimes),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\otimes),C;\\otimes)\\right\\rangle:\nA,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\lambda_A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(I,A;\\otimes),A\\rangle:\nA\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\lambda_A^{-1},A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(I,A;\\otimes)\\rangle:\nA\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\rho_A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,I;\\otimes),A\\rangle:\nA\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\rho_A^{-1},A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,I;\\otimes)\\rangle:\nA\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\langle\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_X,X,X\\rangle:X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\Bigl\\{\\left\\langle\\alpha_{A,B,C},\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\otimes),C;\\otimes),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(B,C;\\otimes);\\otimes)\\right\\rangle:\nA,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\Bigl\\{\\left\\langle\\alpha^{-1}_{A,B,C},\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(B,C;\\otimes);\\otimes),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\otimes),C;\\otimes)\\right\\rangle:\nA,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\lambda_A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(I,A;\\otimes),A\\rangle:\nA\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\lambda_A^{-1},A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(I,A;\\otimes)\\rangle:\nA\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\rho_A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,I;\\otimes),A\\rangle:\nA\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\rho_A^{-1},A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,I;\\otimes)\\rangle:\nA\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C):{}&amp;\n\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\subseteq R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle,\\langle g,X&#39;,Y&#39;\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,g;\\otimes),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(X,X&#39;;\\otimes),\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(Y,Y&#39;;\\otimes)\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle,\\langle g,Y,Z\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f,X,Z\\rangle\\in R\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C):{}&amp;\n\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\subseteq R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle,\\langle g,X&#39;,Y&#39;\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,g;\\otimes),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(X,X&#39;;\\otimes),\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(Y,Y&#39;;\\otimes)\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle,\\langle g,Y,Z\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f,X,Z\\rangle\\in R\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\land\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle\\in\n\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\land\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle\\in\n\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf e_{93}\\coloneqq\\langle93,0\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FAtom}_{93}(A)\\coloneqq\\langle93,1,A\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,t)\\coloneqq\\langle93,2,s,t\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf e_{93}\\coloneqq\\langle93,0\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FAtom}_{93}(A)\\coloneqq\\langle93,1,A\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,t)\\coloneqq\\langle93,2,s,t\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FObj}^{0}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathsf e_{93}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{FAtom}_{93}(A):A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FObj}^{0}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathsf e_{93}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{FAtom}_{93}(A):A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FObj}^{n+1}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FObj}^{n}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,t):s,t\\in\\operatorname{FObj}^{n}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\operatorname{FObj}^{n}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FObj}^{n+1}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FObj}^{n}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,t):s,t\\in\\operatorname{FObj}^{n}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\operatorname{FObj}^{n}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FEvalSpec}_{93}(v;\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\;[\n\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\\\\n&amp;\\land v:\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land v(\\mathsf e_{93})=I\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;(v(\\operatorname{FAtom}_{93}(A))=A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n(v(\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,t))=\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(v(s),v(t);\\otimes))].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FEvalSpec}_{93}(v;\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\;[\n\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\\\\n&amp;\\land v:\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land v(\\mathsf e_{93})=I\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;(v(\\operatorname{FAtom}_{93}(A))=A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n(v(\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,t))=\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(v(s),v(t);\\otimes))].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\coloneqq\\iota v\\;\\mathrm{FEvalSpec}_{93}(v;\\mathfrak M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\coloneqq\\iota v\\;\\mathrm{FEvalSpec}_{93}(v;\\mathfrak M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\land\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\to\\exists!v\\;\\mathrm{FEvalSpec}_{93}(v;\\mathfrak M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\land\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\to\\exists!v\\;\\mathrm{FEvalSpec}_{93}(v;\\mathfrak M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SFAr}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle f,s,t\\rangle:s,t\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\pi_1(\\mathfrak M))\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\pi_1(\\mathfrak M)}\n(\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(s),\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(t))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SFAr}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle f,s,t\\rangle:s,t\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\pi_1(\\mathfrak M))\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\pi_1(\\mathfrak M)}\n(\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(s),\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(t))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SFGen}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\coloneqq\\iota R\\;\\exists\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho,v\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\land v=\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land R=\\Bigl(\n\\{\\langle\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_{v(s)},s,s\\rangle:s\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\alpha_{v(s),v(t),v(u)},\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,t),u),\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(t,u))\\rangle:\ns,t,u\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\alpha^{-1}_{v(s),v(t),v(u)},\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(t,u)),\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,t),u)\\rangle:\ns,t,u\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\lambda_{v(s)},\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(\\mathsf e_{93},s),s\\rangle:\ns\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\lambda^{-1}_{v(s)},s,\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(\\mathsf e_{93},s)\\rangle:\ns\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\rho_{v(s)},\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,\\mathsf e_{93}),s\\rangle:\ns\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\rho^{-1}_{v(s)},s,\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,\\mathsf e_{93})\\rangle:\ns\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SFGen}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\coloneqq\\iota R\\;\\exists\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho,v\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\land v=\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land R=\\Bigl(\n\\{\\langle\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_{v(s)},s,s\\rangle:s\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\alpha_{v(s),v(t),v(u)},\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,t),u),\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(t,u))\\rangle:\ns,t,u\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\alpha^{-1}_{v(s),v(t),v(u)},\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(t,u)),\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,t),u)\\rangle:\ns,t,u\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\lambda_{v(s)},\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(\\mathsf e_{93},s),s\\rangle:\ns\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\lambda^{-1}_{v(s)},s,\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(\\mathsf e_{93},s)\\rangle:\ns\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\rho_{v(s)},\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,\\mathsf e_{93}),s\\rangle:\ns\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\rho^{-1}_{v(s)},s,\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,\\mathsf e_{93})\\rangle:\ns\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SFCanMor}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{R\\subseteq\\operatorname{SFAr}_{93}(\\mathfrak M):{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SFGen}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\subseteq R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle f,s,t\\rangle,\\langle g,u,w\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,g;\\pi_2(\\mathfrak M)),\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,u),\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(t,w)\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle f,s,t\\rangle,\\langle g,t,u\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle g\\circ_{\\pi_1(\\mathfrak M)}f,s,u\\rangle\\in R\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SFCanMor}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{R\\subseteq\\operatorname{SFAr}_{93}(\\mathfrak M):{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SFGen}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\subseteq R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle f,s,t\\rangle,\\langle g,u,w\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,g;\\pi_2(\\mathfrak M)),\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,u),\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(t,w)\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle f,s,t\\rangle,\\langle g,t,u\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle g\\circ_{\\pi_1(\\mathfrak M)}f,s,u\\rangle\\in R\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}(f,s,t;\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\;[\n\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\land\\langle f,s,t\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{SFCanMor}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}(f,s,t;\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\;[\n\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\land\\langle f,s,t\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{SFCanMor}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}(f,s,t;\\mathfrak M)\\to\n\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(s),\n\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(t);\\mathfrak M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}(f,s,t;\\mathfrak M)\\to\n\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(s),\n\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(t);\\mathfrak M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\land\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\\to{}&amp;\n\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{SFGen}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{SFCanMor}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{SFAr}_{93}(\\mathfrak M).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\land\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\\to{}&amp;\n\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{SFGen}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{SFCanMor}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{SFAr}_{93}(\\mathfrak M).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原 Can₉₃ 仍表示实际对象间由幺半约束生成的态射。不能仅凭解释后对象相同就认定两个形式张量表达式相同；新增 SynCan₉₃ 只为一致性定理显式保留形式源、靶信息。两个交集的全集分别是 Ar₉₃ 与 SFAr₉₃，均满足所列闭包条件，故定义族非空。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-monoidal-category","status":"resolved","id":"0f2bb87045d6238a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-monoidal-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-monoidal-category","status":"resolved","id":"0f2bb87045d6238a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak M$ is a six-component monoidal-category candidate; $\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}$, $\\operatorname{Ob}$, and $\\operatorname{Hom}$ are the sourced monoidal-category predicate, object projection, and hom-family notation of [[93-df-monoidal-category]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-monoidal-category","status":"resolved","id":"0f2bb87045d6238a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}$、$\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}$ 及约束逆来自 [[93-df-monoidal-category]]，$\\circ_{\\mathcal C}$ 与 $\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}$ 来自 [[93-df-category]]。$\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}$ 显式记录形式源和形式靶，原 $\\mathrm{Can}_{93}$ 不作重定义为该新关系。","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}$、$\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}$ 及约束逆来自 [[93-df-monoidal-category]]，$\\circ_{\\mathcal C}$ 与 $\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}$ 来自 [[93-df-category]]。$\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}$ 显式记录形式源和形式靶，原 $\\mathrm{Can}_{93}$ 不作重定义为该新关系。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Can}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FObj}^{n}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SFAr}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SFGen}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SFCanMor}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Can}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle:X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\coloneqq{}&\n\\{\\langle\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_X,X,X\\rangle:X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\Bigl\\{\\left\\langle\\alpha_{A,B,C},\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\otimes),C;\\otimes),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(B,C;\\otimes);\\otimes)\\right\\rangle:\nA,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\Bigl\\{\\left\\langle\\alpha^{-1}_{A,B,C},\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(B,C;\\otimes);\\otimes),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\otimes),C;\\otimes)\\right\\rangle:\nA,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\langle\\lambda_A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(I,A;\\otimes),A\\rangle:\nA\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\langle\\lambda_A^{-1},A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(I,A;\\otimes)\\rangle:\nA\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\langle\\rho_A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,I;\\otimes),A\\rangle:\nA\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\langle\\rho_A^{-1},A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,I;\\otimes)\\rangle:\nA\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C):{}&\n\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\subseteq R\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle,\\langle g,X',Y'\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,g;\\otimes),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(X,X';\\otimes),\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(Y,Y';\\otimes)\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle,\\langle g,Y,Z\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f,X,Z\\rangle\\in R\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\land\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle\\in\n\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf e_{93}\\coloneqq\\langle93,0\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FAtom}_{93}(A)\\coloneqq\\langle93,1,A\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,t)\\coloneqq\\langle93,2,s,t\\rangle","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FObj}^{0}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathsf e_{93}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{FAtom}_{93}(A):A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FObj}^{n+1}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FObj}^{n}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,t):s,t\\in\\operatorname{FObj}^{n}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\operatorname{FObj}^{n}_{93}(\\mathcal C)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FEvalSpec}_{93}(v;\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\;[\n\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\\\\n&\\land v:\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land v(\\mathsf e_{93})=I\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;(v(\\operatorname{FAtom}_{93}(A))=A)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n(v(\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,t))=\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(v(s),v(t);\\otimes))].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\coloneqq\\iota v\\;\\mathrm{FEvalSpec}_{93}(v;\\mathfrak M)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\land\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\to\\exists!v\\;\\mathrm{FEvalSpec}_{93}(v;\\mathfrak M)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SFAr}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle f,s,t\\rangle:s,t\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\pi_1(\\mathfrak M))\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\pi_1(\\mathfrak M)}\n(\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(s),\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(t))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SFGen}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\coloneqq\\iota R\\;\\exists\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho,v\\;\\Bigl[{}&\n\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\land v=\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\\\\n&\\land R=\\Bigl(\n\\{\\langle\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_{v(s)},s,s\\rangle:s\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\langle\\alpha_{v(s),v(t),v(u)},\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,t),u),\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(t,u))\\rangle:\ns,t,u\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\langle\\alpha^{-1}_{v(s),v(t),v(u)},\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(t,u)),\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,t),u)\\rangle:\ns,t,u\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\langle\\lambda_{v(s)},\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(\\mathsf e_{93},s),s\\rangle:\ns\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\langle\\lambda^{-1}_{v(s)},s,\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(\\mathsf e_{93},s)\\rangle:\ns\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\langle\\rho_{v(s)},\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,\\mathsf e_{93}),s\\rangle:\ns\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\langle\\rho^{-1}_{v(s)},s,\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,\\mathsf e_{93})\\rangle:\ns\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\}\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SFCanMor}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{R\\subseteq\\operatorname{SFAr}_{93}(\\mathfrak M):{}&\n\\operatorname{SFGen}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\\subseteq R\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\langle f,s,t\\rangle,\\langle g,u,w\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,g;\\pi_2(\\mathfrak M)),\n\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(s,u),\\operatorname{FTen}_{93}(t,w)\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\langle f,s,t\\rangle,\\langle g,t,u\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle g\\circ_{\\pi_1(\\mathfrak M)}f,s,u\\rangle\\in R\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}(f,s,t;\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\;[\n\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\land\\langle f,s,t\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{SFCanMor}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}(f,s,t;\\mathfrak M)\\to\n\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(s),\n\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(t);\\mathfrak M)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\land\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\\to{}&\n\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{SFGen}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{SFCanMor}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{SFAr}_{93}(\\mathfrak M).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":8924,"backlinks":[{"id":"07f5930ce42abb03","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)$ is the least canonical-morphism relation of [[93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism]]."},{"id":"5